"help.login.title" = "Launch at login";
"help.login.body" = "Enable Launch at login on the Automatic switching tab to start Auralim when you log in to macOS. It restores your saved city, offsets, and automatic switching setting. If approval is required, open Login Items Settings and allow Auralim. The switch remains on while approval is pending; the status indicates whether it is active. Turning it off prevents future launches at login and keeps the current app running.";

