"help.location.title" = "Automatic location and travel";
"help.location.body" = "Enabling automatic location for the first time requests macOS location permission. Coordinates, time zone, and fix time are cached only on this Mac and never uploaded. Time zones and sunrise/sunset use local data. A one-time fix is requested every 3 hours without continuous tracking. Manual refresh or a system time-zone change requests a new fix; failures keep the cache, or use the saved manual city if no valid cache exists. Manual mode cancels acquisition and refresh. macOS Location Services may require Wi-Fi or a network. Time-zone boundaries contain information from timezone-boundary-builder, converted by ZoneDetect (2024a), available under ODbL 1.0.";

